a.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/btYUEXkwHkHuoVjol49XoufQSrr.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-18\",\"runtime\":68},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Episode 12\",\"overview\":\"Daley has left the house and the celebrities try to become one big happy family. Ella feels the weight of Daley's departure and tensions are on the rise again.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z14NwimxfGlhtZGfKPaiUMZy7lP.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-20\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Episode 13\",\"overview\":\"The Big Brother house gets an Easter makeover and a surprise visitor stops by. Plus, face-to-face nominations cause tears to spill with a shocking twist that leaves housemates reeling.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5kNcQ02Eg96qx9ocqLOjpANqHTK.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-21\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Episode 14\",\"overview\":\"JoJo tries to become an honorary Brit as some housemates sabotage her efforts. Angellica shares her feelings with JoJo and a TRIPLE eviction looms!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h0gVvT8tUxvNyC3rAwi5dGGVAKS.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-22\",\"runtime\":68},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Episode 15\",\"overview\":\"The celebrities share their thoughts with Patsy's talking stick and prepare themselves for the triple eviction - will the house dynamics change when the next batch exit?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yKp7b3aFgtIKgPPKJltsPpaDA55.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-23\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Episode 16\",\"overview\":\"The celebs are feeling reflective as they receive their letters from home, discussing the journeys made and relationships formed within the house.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qvmhLDnrYpkcay2b6VQjiuQj93Q.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-24\",\"runtime\":46},{\"nu